 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "King Zedekiah made a covenant with all the people",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.78,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "To proclaim liberty for every Hebrew slave",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.08,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The officials and the crowd who entered the pact",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.55,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Obeyed the word and set their brothers free",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.55,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But you turned back and profaned my name",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.69,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Took back the men and women you had released",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.71,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I made a covenant with your fathers long ago",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.68,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But you did not listen to the voice of the Lord",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.7,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "You cut the calf in two and walked between the pieces",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.75,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Profaning the name in the house that bears my glory",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.38,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I will make you like the calf they cut in half",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.75,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Your corpses food for birds and beasts of the earth",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.73,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But you turned back and profaned my name",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.68,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Took back the men and women you had released",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.51,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I made a covenant with your fathers long ago",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.68,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But you did not listen to the voice of the Lord",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.72,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "So now I proclaim liberty for you declares the Lord",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.27,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Liberty to the sword and to the plague and famine",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.48,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I will make you a horror to all the kingdoms of the earth",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.33,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Handing you over to those who seek your lives",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.51,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Zedekiah and his officials will face their enemies",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.91,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The army of Babylon that has withdrawn from you",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.17,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "They will fight against this city and capture it",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.64,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And burn it down to make a desolation",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.67,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
